<section class="section section--navy" id="platforms">
  <div class="wrap pg-platforms">
    <div class="pg-platforms__intro">
      <h2>Interactive platforms</h2>
      <p>Fishers, officials, scientists, industry and civil society sit down together on one issue at a time and agree recommendations for policy makers.</p>
      <img src="/assets/img/hybrid-vessel-webinar.webp" alt="Session poster: Game changing concept, hybrid fishing vessel to combat fuel crisis, 8 July 2022" width="900" height="1273" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <ol class="pg-list">
      <li>
        <time>8 Jul 2022</time>
        <div>
          <h3>A hybrid fishing vessel to combat the fuel crisis</h3>
          <p>Online session on hybrid propulsion to keep small boats at sea when fuel is scarce and costly.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="pg-list__tag">Webinar</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <time>5 Jun 2022</time>
        <div>
          <h3>Fishing for food security without gas-guzzling</h3>
          <p>Department of Fisheries, boat builders, a solar supplier, the National Science Foundation, civil society and fisher leaders on fuel efficiency: subsidies, solar and sail, slower speeds and craft maintenance.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="pg-list__tag">Platform 5</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <time>2018–22</time>
        <div>
          <h3>Post-harvest losses, fish processing and gender</h3>
          <p>How losses after landing fall hardest on the women who process and sell fish, and what can be done.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="pg-list__tag">Platform 3</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <time>14 Aug 2018</time>
        <div>
          <h3>Destructive fishing</h3>
          <p>Illegal and destructive gear and methods, followed by a policy brief.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="pg-list__tag">Platform</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <time>2018</time>
        <div>
          <h3>Bottom trawling</h3>
          <p>Trawling in Sri Lankan waters, including Indian trawlers in the Palk Strait, followed by a policy brief.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="pg-list__tag">Platform 1</span>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

